  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc92:1.2": "That is, four fingerbreadths. For a discussion of the <i lang='pi' translate='no'>aṅgula</i>, see <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sugata</i> in Appendix of Technical Terms. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc92:1.3": "Here I render <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sugata</i> as “Buddha”, which seems required by the narrative. I do not think, however, that this narrative usage determines the interpretation of <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sugata</i> when used in a technical sense in connection with measures, for which I prefer the rendering “standard”, see word analysis below. For a full discussion of <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sugata</i>, see the Appendix of Technical Terms. ",
